      "definition": "People start to see the issue in a new way.",
      "example": "Sleep framed as a school-schedule problem, not teen laziness.",
      "skos:note": "Informed by: HFRP CLM: issue reframing (idea)"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://health-culture.org/vocab/advocacy/outcomes/act",
